[en.FOCUS_C12_SECOND_BATCH_OF_SPONSORSHIP]
Second Batch of  Sponsorship

[en.FOCUS_C12_SECOND_BATCH_OF_SPONSORSHIP_desc]
Las Pegasus has sent us a telegram. Their Minister of Trade has been instructed to visit our quarry farm. As usual, he hopes to discuss further assistance matters with us...

[zh.FOCUS_C12_SECOND_BATCH_OF_SPONSORSHIP]
第二批无偿援助

[zh.FOCUS_C12_SECOND_BATCH_OF_SPONSORSHIP_desc]
